      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you, but it feels like you're being pretty one-sided. you're calling the desire for national pride a \"myth\" and saying it's just to \"maintain the status quo.\" isn't that a bit extreme? a lot of people just want their kids to grow up feeling positive about their identity and their country. shouldn't a school be able to teach both the bad and the good without just picking a side?",
